  "_about": "Frozen at 61716599 from tokenTiers and auth presets, before roles replaced tiers. always_asked_routes: permissions of routes every token tier filed as an agent request (alwaysAsk). handler_always_asked: permissions whose handler filed a request for every tier (metadata-handlers.go touchesAdmin: team:manage_roles; auth-handlers.go revokeSession of another person: team:revoke). A legacy token loses the union of both (legacyNeverDirect). agent_ceiling: what the agent role held for a read/draft/send token (every preset below admin), without agent_requests:*.",
